{"id":"b12a36bd580ec12e","group":"14","path":"14/14-df-topological-direct-image.md","title":"Definition II.1 Direct Image of a Topological Sheaf","display":"Definition II.1 Direct Image of a Topological Sheaf","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-df-topological-direct-image","aliases":["14-df-topological-direct-image"],"display":"Definition II.1 Direct Image of a Topological Sheaf","depends_on":["[[14-df-topological-sheaf]]","[[14-df-etale-maps-and-local-sections]]","[[14-thm-sheaf-of-continuous-sections]]"],"source_location":"II.1 printed 68; II.9 printed 99; DjVu 40,55","source_evidence":"附件中的原稿来源记录；本次修订不构成对相应原书或 OCR 的读取证明。"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-df-topological-direct-image"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-df-topological-direct-image</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Definition II.1 Direct Image of a Topological Sheaf"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f9af6d7fc5c4f8a0\" href=\"?note=f9af6d7fc5c4f8a0\" title=\"14-df-topological-sheaf\">14-df-topological-sheaf</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"afeb22707a474889\" href=\"?note=afeb22707a474889\" title=\"14-df-etale-maps-and-local-sections\">14-df-etale-maps-and-local-sections</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"83765a3303e549f5\" href=\"?note=83765a3303e549f5\" title=\"14-thm-sheaf-of-continuous-sections\">14-thm-sheaf-of-continuous-sections</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_location","html":"II.1 printed 68; II.9 printed 99; DjVu 40,55"},{"key":"source_evidence","html":"附件中的原稿来源记录；本次修订不构成对相应原书或 OCR 的读取证明。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>固定 Grothendieck 宇宙 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V\\)</span>；空间载体、截面值与指标集均取于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\">\\(\\mathcal U\\)</span>，有关范畴和函子集合在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal V\\)</span> 中处理。</p>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:(X,\\tau)\\to(Y,\\nu)\">\\(f:(X,\\tau)\\to(Y,\\nu)\\)</span> 连续；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 上的层，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 也是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 上的层，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h:F\\to G\">\\(h:F\\to G\\)</span> 为自然变换；另设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g:(Y,\\nu)\\to(Z,\\xi)\">\\(g:(Y,\\nu)\\to(Z,\\xi)\\)</span> 连续。记号见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"afeb22707a474889\" href=\"?note=afeb22707a474889\" title=\"14-df-etale-maps-and-local-sections\">14-df-etale-maps-and-local-sections</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"83765a3303e549f5\" href=\"?note=83765a3303e549f5\" title=\"14-thm-sheaf-of-continuous-sections\">14-thm-sheaf-of-continuous-sections</a>。对象和态射分量取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\\in\\nu\">\\(V\\in\\nu\\)</span>，限制公式取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V,W\\in\\nu\">\\(V,W\\in\\nu\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\\subseteq V\">\\(W\\subseteq V\\)</span>；所写底层限制函数按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"f9af6d7fc5c4f8a0\" href=\"?note=f9af6d7fc5c4f8a0\" title=\"14-df-topological-sheaf\">14-df-topological-sheaf</a> 包装为集合箭头。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsSheaf}\">\\(\\mathrm{IsSheaf}\\)</span> 沿用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"f9af6d7fc5c4f8a0\" href=\"?note=f9af6d7fc5c4f8a0\" title=\"14-df-topological-sheaf\">14-df-topological-sheaf</a> 中的精确签名。 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{id}_A\">\\(\\mathrm{id}_A\\)</span> 表示集合或函子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的恒等映射。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(f_*F)(V)=F(f^{-1}[V]),\\qquad\\rho^V_{f_*F,W}=\\rho^{f^{-1}[V]}_{F,f^{-1}[W]}\\quad(W\\subseteq V\\in\\nu).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(f_*F)(V)=F(f^{-1}[V]),\\qquad\\rho^V_{f_*F,W}=\\rho^{f^{-1}[V]}_{F,f^{-1}[W]}\\quad(W\\subseteq V\\in\\nu).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(f_*h)_V=h_{f^{-1}[V]},\\qquad\\mathrm{IsSheaf}(f_*F,Y,\\nu),\\qquad\\mathrm{id}_*F=F,\\qquad(gf)_*F=g_*(f_*F).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(f_*h)_V=h_{f^{-1}[V]},\\qquad\\mathrm{IsSheaf}(f_*F,Y,\\nu),\\qquad\\mathrm{id}_*F=F,\\qquad(gf)_*F=g_*(f_*F).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>连续性保证取值位置仍是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 的开集。逆像保并和有限交，因此 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y\">\\(Y\\)</span> 中的覆盖及匹配条件送到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 中，应用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 的层条件即得直像是层。复合式按 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(gf)^{-1}=f^{-1}g^{-1}\">\\((gf)^{-1}=f^{-1}g^{-1}\\)</span> 逐开集成立。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-topological-sheaf","status":"resolved","id":"f9af6d7fc5c4f8a0","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-topological-sheaf]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-etale-maps-and-local-sections","status":"resolved","id":"afeb22707a474889","anchor":"ref-2","ta