t":"设 $f:(X,\\tau)\\to(Y,\\nu)$ 连续，$G\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathbf{Sh}(Y,\\nu))$、$F\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathbf{Sh}(X,\\tau))$。$t_{V,s}$、$f^*,f_*$ 见 [[14-df-topological-inverse-image]]、[[14-df-topological-direct-image]]，$\\eta_F$ 见 [[14-thm-sheaf-recovery-from-germ-sections]]。分量公式的参数为 $V\\in\\nu$、$s\\in G(V)$、$U\\in\\tau$、$t\\in(f^*G)(U)$；$\\eta_{F,U}^{-1}$ 是层恢复同构分量的底层逆函数。"}],"outgoing":["f9af6d7fc5c4f8a0","afeb22707a474889","83765a3303e549f5"]}